        "url": "/api/v2/version/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "KOFFING embodies toxic substances.\nIt mixes the toxins with raw garbage to\nset off a chemical reaction that\fresults in a terribly powerful poison\ngas. The higher the temperature, the\nmore gas is concocted by this POKéMON.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Getting up close to a KOFFING will give\nyou a chance to observe, through its thin\nskin, the toxic gases swirling inside. It\nblows up at the slightest stimulation.",
